      "problem": "Find $K+L-(K+J)$, if\n\n$$\nJ=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,K=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,L=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
